# 🏗️ SaaS Architecture Audit — Commerce Engine
> Where you are vs. where you need to be. What works, what's missing, and how to close the gap.

---

## 📐 What You're Actually Building

A **Bangladesh-focused F-commerce SaaS** with the following layers:

```
┌─────────────────────── Commerce Engine Platform ───────────────────────┐
│                                                                          │
│  [/]  Marketing Landing     ← CmsLandingPage (exists ✅)               │
│  [/plans]  Pricing          ← CmsPricing (exists ✅)                   │
│  [/signup]  Merchant signup ← MerchantSignup + Edge Function (exists ✅)│
│                                                                          │
│  [/admin/*]  Merchant Admin ← AdminLayout + views (exists, buggy ⚠️)   │
│                                                                          │
│  [store.yourdomain.com/]    ← StorefrontPage via subdomain (partial ⚠️)│
│  [/stores/slug]             ← Store preview route (exists ✅)           │
│  [/slug]                    ← CMS page route (exists ✅)                │
│                                                                          │
│  [/admin/platform]          ← Platform Control Plane (exists ✅)        │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

